 improvements to the announce mode minimaps\nSlightly increased performance of the game\nDrastically decreased the storage requirements of the game (now only about 2/3rds of the original size)\nImproved the AI player run animation\nFixed some visual issues with the field minimaps in announcer mode\nNew Features:\nAdded a strike zone size toggle in multiplayer 1v1\nAdded announcer controls to Free Roam!", "created_date": 1790797315, "id": "28541695428782748", "version": "2.5888", "version_code": 5888, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28541690315449926"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3256881337690839", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28566584332960524"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1790364748, "id": "28481770064775285", "version": "2.5887", "version_code": 5887, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28481763891442569"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3256881337690839", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28566584332960524"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3208127792574896"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes (Live v2.5886):\nBug Fixes:\nFixed an issue causing the strike zone to squish itself in singleplayer when the pro size is selected and the player gets reset as a batter\